1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,940
Using Language Reading and Writing

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,100
A Sad Love Story

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,240
Li Fang was heartbroken.

4
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:17,080
It was Valentine’s Day and Hu Jin had said she would meet him at the coffee shop

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:17,960
after work.

6
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,800
But she didn’t turn up.

7
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:23,540
She could be with her friends right now laughing at him.

8
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:32,020
He had looked forward to meeting her all day,

9
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:35,340
and now he was alone with his roses and chocolates,

10
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,520
like a fool.

11
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:41,060
Well, he was not going to hold his breath for her to apologize.

12
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:44,220
He would drown his sadness in coffee.

13
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,200
It was obvious that the manager of the coffee shop was waiting

14
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:52,100
for Li Fang to leave - he wiped the tables,

15
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:56,840
then sat down and turned on the TV -just what Li Fang needed!

16
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,180
A sad Chinese story about lost love.

17
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:04,680
The granddaughter of the Goddess of Heaven visited the earth.

18
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:14,480
While she was on earth she met the herd boy Niulang and they fell in love.

19
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:20,140
Just like me and Hu Jin," thought Li Fang.) They got married secretly,

20
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:21,780
and they were very happy.

21
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:27,780
We could be like that," thought Li Fang.) When the Goddess of Heaven knew

22
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:30,280
that her granddaughter was married to a human,

23
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:35,040
she became very angry and made the weaving girl return to Heaven.

24
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:39,220
Niulang tried to follow her, but the river of stars,

25
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,760
the Milky Way, stopped him.

26
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:56,460
Magpies make a bridge of their wings so the couple can cross the river to meet on the

27
00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:58,960
seventh day of the seventh lunar month.

28
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:15,200
The announcer said, "This is the story of Qiqiao Festival.

29
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:25,440
It’s a fine day today, so I hope you can all meet the one you love."

30
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,960
As Li Fang set off

31
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:32,040
for home, he thought, "I guess Hu Jin doesn’t love me.

32
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:34,920
I’ll just throw these flowers and chocolates away.

33
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:38,800
I don’t want them to remind me of her." So he did.

34
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:43,380
As he sadly passed the tea shop on the corner on his way home,

35
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:45,140
he heard a voice calling him.

36
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:48,740
There was Hu Jin waving at him and calling, "

37
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,860
Why are you so late?

38
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:53,180
I’ve been waiting for you for a long time!

39
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:57,360
And I have a gift for you!" What would he do?

40
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,980
He had thrown away her Valentine gifts!

41
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:02,320
She would never forgive him.

42
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,860
This would not be a happy Valentine’s Day!
